                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                        "entry_id": "7f54d900-3094-3ec7-9b7f-59475ba22856",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A prison warder."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5dbcdd3-6bf3-45c2-afd8-ffe5b7556d58",
                                "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                                "text": "There are some 32 different terms for prison officers, from the humorously affectionate kanga(rhyming slang:kangaroo = screw) and the variants Scooby-Doo and Dr. Who via the mildly confrontational German (as if still the enemy over 50 years after World War II!) to the outright abuse of shit-parcel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2a5d76a-27e4-45eb-8a70-5709b7d7c057",
                                "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                                "text": "So we thought there'd been trouble over there, maybe all the kangas were getting into mufti."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48f567ae-50b2-454f-8707-db4cacfb5111",
                                "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                                "text": "‘Fucking loony bin more like. There's no one sick here, not physically anyway. Don't worry, you'll get used to it. It's the kangas you want to watch out for.‘\n‘Kangas?’\n‘Kangaroo. Screw.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d377b585-082c-4860-9dca-ecf9af315943",
                                "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                                "text": "The kangas allow me the bottles for my ships."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1374d9f6-1c54-4e92-b01b-21fc7d9441a7",
                                "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                                "text": "They will f***ing dangle you, the kangas. [They'll] make it look like suicide."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b84ecf55-f143-46bd-8aae-6dbf8648674b",
                                "sense_id": "3354ade1-85a6-3a19-9683-b6f5114faf41",
                                "text": "Even the diversionary fracas on the far side of the room failed to divert him, although the kangas went racing across to deal with it — there was always some kind of a dust up going on."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
